{
  "h1": [
    "One drop of soap,",
    "and floating pepper",
    "races to the edge",
    "of the bowl.",
    "Nothing touched it.",
    "So what pulls the pepper?"
  ],
  "h2": [
    "Not the soap.",
    "Clean water further out",
    "pulls harder",
    "than the soapy spot,",
    "and drags the surface outward.",
    "In one lab study,",
    "that surface reached",
    "up to 0.5m/s."
  ],
  "h3": [
    "Yet with soap",
    "fed in steadily,",
    "the rush stops",
    "at a ring.",
    "Why there?"
  ],
  "h4": [
    "Here is the engine.",
    "At twenty five degrees,",
    "clean water pulls harder",
    "than our soap",
    "from episode two,",
    "SDS at an inferred 25mM",
    "in water:",
    "a gap of 35.54",
    "millinewtons per metre, calculated.",
    "That gap,",
    "not the soap itself,",
    "does the pulling."
  ],
  "c1": [
    "Every patch of that surface",
    "pulls on its neighbours.",
    "Over clean water",
    "the pull is strong;",
    "over the soapy spot",
    "it is weaker.",
    "A flow driven",
    "by a difference in pull",
    "like this is called",
    "a Marangoni flow."
  ],
  "p1": [
    "Flow drags water outward."
  ]
